# Scala: Scala 3 Language Reference and Scala Language Specification (lexical syntax); requirements/languages/scala.md
name     scala sc

keyword  abstract case catch class def do else enum export extends final finally for given if implicit
keyword  import lazy match new object override package private protected return sealed then throw trait
keyword  try type val var while with yield using extension inline opaque transparent derives this super
type     Int Long Short Byte Double Float Boolean Char String Unit Any AnyRef AnyVal Nothing Null Option
type     List Seq Map Set
builtin  true false null None Some println print

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   """ """  : multiline
string   " "      : escapes
prefix   s f      : interp=dollar
prefix   raw      : literal interp=dollar
escape        : u4
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~#
calls
decorators
hook     apostrophe
